		{
			dependencies: ["64E7B4BEB420192D"]
			description: [
				"Powered armour that runs on air and is upgraded with modules."
				""
				"&7The &eHelmet&r alone gives you an entity tracker, block tracker, a HUD and search highlighting. The full set adds flight, speed, magnets, jump boost and damage reduction.&r"
				""
				"&e&lEvery feature is a separate upgrade you install and can toggle in-game.&r Open the helmet's GUI to configure what is active - running everything at once drains air fast."
				""
				"&8It is one of the best armour sets in the pack and it is available a long way before the endgame gear in Act III.&r"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "pneumaticcraft:pneumatic_helmet"
				tag: {
					Damage: 0
				}
			}
			id: "4ABC1C11D5ACBF55"
			rewards: [
