		{
			description: [
				"Binds to a player and exposes their inventory, XP and hunger to machines."
				""
				"&7Pipe items straight into your own inventory from anywhere on the network, drain XP into a fluid, or feed yourself automatically.&r"
				""
				"&8Needs a lot of pressure to hold the link. It is a luxury block, but a genuinely convenient one.&r"
