		{
			description: [
				"The starter compressor is slow and wastes fuel. These do not."
				""
				"&e&lAdvanced Air Compressor&r - same idea, much better efficiency and a higher ceiling."
				"&e&lLiquid Compressor&r - burns Diesel, LPG or Kerosene straight from your Refinery instead of solid fuel."
				"&e&lFlux Compressor&r - converts FE into air, which finally connects PneumaticCraft to the rest of your base."
				"&e&lElectrostatic Compressor&r - collects lightning. Situational, and excellent when it works."
				""
				"&7The Flux Compressor is the one that matters here: it means your Mekanism reactors and Create generators can drive this entire chapter.&r"
			]
			icon: "pneumaticcraft:advanced_air_compressor"
			id: "3391C25F7E3F97B8"
			rewards: [{
				id: "2D65E6B090D20C01"
