				"&7Swap drill bits to change what it is good at - a compressed iron bit for general work, netherite for everything else. Vein-mining and area modes are built in.&r"
				""
				"&8Also worth making: the Pneumatic Wrench, which rotates and dismantles machines in one click.&r"
