			description: [
				"&3&lYou can manufacture circuit boards on an assembly line.&r"
				""
				"Oil becomes plastic. Plastic becomes boards. Boards become drones, and drones do the work. Nothing in that chain fits in a crafting grid, and that is the point."
				""
				"&7&lWhat this unlocks:&r GregTech. Its machines are gated behind the boards you now make automatically - the Assembly Line was the rehearsal, and what comes next is the same idea at industrial scale, across nine voltage tiers.&r"
				""
				"&8Sixteen boards is not an arbitrary number. You will want a steady supply before you start GregTech, not a stack you made by hand.&r"
